Query

To show information about a building use this tool and click on the building in question.

The information is shown in the lower right corner, instead of the minimap.

Press 'g' to show underground information. 'm' and 'n' cycle through optional pages

There are no costs to use this tool. Alternatively use the middle mouse key or press 'g'
to display information on the ground.

